From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Norman Herms <dockseed@proton.me>
Date: Sun, 4 Oct 2026 18:28:50 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] dt-bindings: phy: sun50i-a64-usb-phy: Add the A733 USB PHY

The A733 has a two-port USB 2.0 PHY for its USB0 and USB1 controllers,
which is programmed like the one of the D1. Add an A733 compatible with
the D1 one as fallback.

Tested on Radxa Cubie A7S: booted on two boards; the PHY node with this
compatible and the D1 fallback binds to the existing driver, and the
USB-A port enumerates its hub and a stick through it.

Assisted-by: LLM
---
 .../devicetree/bindings/phy/allwinner,sun50i-a64-usb-phy.yaml    | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/phy/allwinner,sun50i-a64-usb-phy.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/phy/allwinner,sun50i-a64-usb-phy.yaml
index 580c3296a18d..da4ad6fb3531 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/phy/allwinner,sun50i-a64-usb-phy.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/phy/allwinner,sun50i-a64-usb-phy.yaml
@@ -23,6 +23,7 @@ properties:
           - enum:
               - allwinner,sun50i-a100-usb-phy
               - allwinner,sun55i-a523-usb-phy
+              - allwinner,sun60i-a733-usb-phy
           - const: allwinner,sun20i-d1-usb-phy
 
   reg:
